'''''Carex asturica''''' is a [[Bunch grass|tussock]]-forming species of perennial [[Carex|sedge]] in the family [[Cyperaceae]]. It is [[Native species|native]] to parts of [[Spain]] and [[Portugal]].<ref name=kew>{{cite web |url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:298685-1|title=''Carex asturica'' Boiss. |access-date=6 March 2023 |publisher=Kew Science – Plants of the World Online}}</ref>

